# #407: without this file, the first `git add .` in a scaffolded project
# commits the two things a local setup creates right here — the signing key
# pair the README's Usage generates, and the `.env` (holding SESSION_SECRET)
# the compose files read.

# Secrets and per-machine configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
config/clients.yaml
config/*.local.conf

# Build output and dependencies
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
